<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-DELY VALDES SIGNS FOR OVIEDO..</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DELY VALDES SIGNS FOR OVIEDO..</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Real Oviedo confirmed on Thursday they had signed Panamanian striker Julio Cesar Dely Valdes from Paris St Germain.</p>
<p>Dely Valdes, 30, will be reunited with the new Oviedo coach Oscar Washington Taberez.</p>
<p>The pair were formerly together at the Italian club Cagliari during the 1993 and 1994 seasons.</p>
<p>The Panamanian is Taberez's second signing in as many days. On Wednesday he acquired the Argentine goalkeeper Jose Maria Buljubasich from Tenerife.</p>
</text>
